WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.255
"I can't wait," said Bird.

2
00:00:12.256 --> 00:00:15.843
"Kip is going to be so surprised."

3
00:00:15.844 --> 00:00:18.785
It was Kip's birthday.

4
00:00:18.786 --> 00:00:21.353
Bird was planning a surprise party.

5
00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.906
It was going to be at the pond.

6
00:00:23.907 --> 00:00:38.225
Everyone in the park was invited.

7
00:00:38.226 --> 00:00:49.252
Bird flew to her nest for party hats.

8
00:00:49.253 --> 00:00:52.120
Kip poked his head out of his hole.

9
00:00:52.121 --> 00:00:56.159
"Today is my birthday," said Kip.

10
00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:02.028
"I know," said Bird. "Happy Birthday."

11
00:01:02.029 --> 00:01:05.989
"I'll see you at my party," said Kip.

12
00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:07.914
Bird gulped.

13
00:01:07.915 --> 00:01:11.406
"Umm, what party?" she asked.

14
00:01:11.407 --> 00:01:23.503
"I'm planning a party for myself," said Kip.

15
00:01:23.504 --> 00:01:27.370
"It's going to be at the giant rock.

16
00:01:27.371 --> 00:01:30.104
Everyone in the park is invited."

17
00:01:30.105 --> 00:01:32.946
"Oh no!" thought Bird.

18
00:01:32.947 --> 00:01:36.637
Kip was planning his own party!

19
00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:39.817
And Bird was planning a party too.

20
00:01:39.818 --> 00:01:42.984
But Bird couldn't tell Kip.

21
00:01:42.985 --> 00:01:47.629
Her party was a surprise.

22
00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:52.039
"What am I going to do?" wondered Bird.

